{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_title", "source_sha256": "fe09b3b6fbdad8338e05f7d8aed9406ac6c599dd076a9e76d064ba9f62a31167", "ja": "静香とおでかけ2", "zh": "和静香外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "533149e098c3f29b347cda04c54e9c812d5caa44f5722390c598995c1a955923", "ja": "静香とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与静香外出一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed0dee38d1ed3cc8e1064c603517dc63de97977487e6f2c586dd2c26f47dc9d1", "ja": "（食い倒れの街、大阪……。オフの静香と一緒に\n連れだってきたものの、もうお腹が一杯になってきた）", "zh": "（美食之都大阪……虽然和休假的静香结伴来到了这里，但肚子已经快要吃饱了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "cfef806731f12483f73b5b7bf1aed24cf8b647de23d60e810681d64a57e79583", "ja": "{$P$}、もう限界ですか？\nたいしたことないですね！　私はまだ余裕です。", "zh": "{$P$}，已经到极限了吗？\n真没什么嘛！我还绰绰有余呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e6b05d0218f0fc3e854bed192d8cce2986e73e2fe069fb3b1334a77a6415ec9c", "ja": "ううっ。そりゃ静香は若いから、\nいくらでも入るだろうけど。俺はもう……。", "zh": "呜呜。毕竟静香你年轻，\n想吃多少都装得下吧。我已经快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "68c91e9093ef2a9b52cc81849d39099f921df7a61f0cd411c9527de9ba993c67", "ja": "何を情けないこと言ってるんですか！　せっかく\n大阪に来たんですから、限界まで食べないと！", "zh": "您在说什么丧气话呢！难得来到大阪，不吃到极限可不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "75ca96c96f616b1305f7c348841c4124a90913dddc271873f04696a5803b5a99", "ja": "なんだか美奈子みたいな事を言うな……ん？\n今、すごい勢いでたこやきの屋台が通り過ぎたぞ！？", "zh": "说得有点像美奈子啊……嗯？\n刚才有个章鱼烧摊以惊人的速度驶过去了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "db70d596df02d571216a19eec138c6b3289dd3493f49306182f9fc253734a9a2", "ja": "私も見ました！　すごい速さですね。もしかしたら、\nお客の力量を試すタイプの屋台なのかも……そうだ！", "zh": "我也看到了！速度真快。说不定是那种会考验客人实力的摊位……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "3cbf722c55442b0919adc5801a8e8025ab852269c7f0b5fb2a9974bfe0442a6a", "ja": "追いかけますよ、{$P$}！　挑戦\nしましょう！　それに、走ればお腹も減るでしょうし！", "zh": "我来追上去，{$P$}！我们来挑战吧！而且，跑起来的话肚子也会饿的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b684c7994f9d05fe8e8d81a295e386c615e4823b15e772432053b8a90e40f012", "ja": "あっ、待ってくれ、静香……！", "zh": "啊，等等我，静香……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "5d3dd72106548b0716d18e09c1894634ba67aba0fe7d42253ecbf848d7a8be23", "ja": "ぜえ、はあ……。やっと買えた……。はむっ。\n……！！　おいしい！", "zh": "呼……哈……终于买到了……。啊呜。\n\n……！！好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "6e1dc16a1475aa004774d332cfa3cc4c2be79b4e2c15b2a54838d2ed6ea8fa13", "ja": "たこやき屋台『夢幻』！　まさに夢か幻かという\n逸品です！　私たち、勝利しましたね……！", "zh": "章鱼烧摊“梦幻”！真可谓如梦似幻的极品！我们赢了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_015siz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_015siz02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e093c5ea0150b51a12a299cdb2282221c95e2322d66f3047d8f02ea45e53cd6b", "ja": "（かなり疲れたが、たこやきの美味しさは最高だった！\n静香のおかげで、挑戦する気持ちを思い出せたな！）", "zh": "（虽然相当累，但章鱼烧实在太好吃了！多亏了静香，我又想起了挑战的心情啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
